# L §5.19 One movement on two statements: "Where the two rows disagree on an amount or a day, ... a read of the
# movement away from its places (its leg's amount in observed, in flows of a move or through a binding) is the
# disagreement's hole, HOLE-SAME, naming both rows"; L §8.1 HOLE-SAME "<p> and <q> are one, but <x> differs on <d>:
# <a> (<row>) and <b> (<row>)". L5_19_same_rows_flows_once with sav's row at 940.00 (M2 patch case P35): flows of save
# and observed are that hole, sav books its own statement's 940.00, and WARN-LEGS is printed.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-03-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input keep: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to sav amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - keep)

ask q_save: flows(save, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31)
ask q_obs: observed(save[2026-03]).cash.amount
ask q_sav: bal(sav, 2026-03-31)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 940.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "b"
  same bank[a2] = bank[b1]
=== expect
q_obs: ?"bank[a2] and bank[b1] are one, but the amount of cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[b1])" (bank[a2], bank[b1])
  cut 2026-04-10
q_sav: 940.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-10
q_save: ?"bank[a2] and bank[b1] are one, but the amount of cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[b1])" (bank[a2], bank[b1])
  cut 2026-04-10
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of save[2026-03] disagree: bank[a2] (950.00 PLN) and bank[b1] (940.00 PLN)
